Dialogue: 3,0:00:07.22,0:00:08.66,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你正漫步于这片幽深的林莽
Dialogue: 2,0:00:07.22,0:00:08.66,Default-#1,atg3,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You're walking in the woods
Dialogue: 3,0:00:09.41,0:00:12.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}四野阒寂无人 而你的手机屏幕也已如死灰般熄灭
