Dialogue: 3,0:00:12.68,0:00:14.84,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}在视野的边缘 那一抹余光里 你瞥见了他
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.68,0:00:14.84,Default-#1,atg3,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Out of the corner of your eye, you spot him
