Dialogue: 3,0:00:23.62,0:00:24.81,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他在逼近！
Dialogue: 2,0:00:23.62,0:00:24.81,Default-#1,atg3,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's gaining on you
Dialogue: 3,0:00:24.81,0:00:25.85,Default-L2,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}希亚·拉博夫
Dialogue: 2,0:00:24.81,0:00:25.85,Default-L2-#1,atg4,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Shia LaBeouf
