Dialogue: 3,0:00:30.84,0:00:32.24,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他已迫在眉睫
Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.84,0:00:32.24,Default-#1,atg3,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}He's almost upon you now,
Dialogue: 3,0:00:32.24,0:00:34.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你能看见那张脸上 血迹斑斑！
