Dialogue: 3,0:00:37.46,0:00:38.29,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}为了生存而亡命奔逃
Dialogue: 2,0:00:37.46,0:00:38.29,Default-#1,atg3,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Running for your life.
