Dialogue: 3,0:02:19.80,0:02:22.18,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你向右反杀 正中他的颈项
Dialogue: 2,0:02:19.80,0:02:22.18,Default-#1,atg3,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You counter to the right, you catch him in the neck
Dialogue: 3,0:02:22.18,0:02:25.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你正在斩下他的头颅……
Dialogue: 2,0:02:22.18,0:02:25.00,Default-#1,atg3,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You're chopping off his head now
Dialogue: 3,0:02:25.00,0:02:27.21,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你刚刚 枭首了希亚·拉博夫
Dialogue: 2,0:02:25.00,0:02:27.21,Default-#1,atg3,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You have just decapitated Shia LaBeouf
Dialogue: 3,0:02:27.68,0:02:31.11,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他的头颅滚落地板 神情木然
Dialogue: 2,0:02:27.68,0:02:31.11,Default-#1,atg3,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}His head topples to the floor, expressionless
Dialogue: 3,0:02:31.72,0:02:34.56,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你颓然跪地 贪婪地攫取着空气
Dialogue: 2,0:02:31.72,0:02:34.56,Default-#1,atg3,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You fall to your knees and catch your breath
Dialogue: 3,0:02:35.57,0:02:39.34,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你终获解脱 世间再无希亚·拉博夫
Dialogue: 2,0:02:35.57,0:02:39.34,Default-#1,atg3,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You're finally safe from Shia LaBeouf
Dialogue: 3,0:02:51.57,0:02:58.62,Default-#2,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}(这个是Shia LaBeouf)